      "y": 327.399,
      "nodeOffset": 0,
      "start": 304,
      "end": 385
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "index": 41,
      "text": "entirely.",
      "x": 143.866,
      "y": 316.49,
      "nodeOffset": 0,
      "start": 386,
      "end": 395
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Experiments on two machine translation tasks show these models to",
      "x": 182.928159088,
      "y": 316.49,
      "nodeOffset": 0,
      "start": 396,
      "end": 461
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "index": 44,
      "text": "be superior in quality while being more parallelizable and requiring significantly",
      "x": 143.866,
      "y": 305.581,
      "nodeOffset": 0,
      "start": 462,
      "end": 544
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "index": 45,
      "text": "less time to train. Our model achieves 28.4 BLEU on the WMT 2014 English-",
      "x": 143.866,
      "y": 294.672,
      "nodeOffset": 0,
      "start": 545,
      "end": 618
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "index": 46,
      "text": "to-German translation task, improving over the existing best results, including",
      "x": 143.866,
      "y": 283.762,
      "nodeOffset": 0,
      "start": 618,
      "end": 697
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "index": 47,
      "text": "ensembles, by over 2 BLEU. On the WMT 2014 English-to-French translation task,",
      "x": 143.866,
      "y": 272.853,
      "nodeOffset": 0,
      "start": 698,
      "end": 776
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "index": 48,
      "text": "our model establishes a new single-model state-of-the-art BLEU score of 41.8 after",
      "x": 143.866,
      "y": 261.944,
      "nodeOffset": 0,
      "start": 777,
      "end": 859
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "index": 49,
      "text": "training for 3.5 days on eight GPUs, a small fraction of the training costs of the",
      "x": 143.866,
      "y": 251.035,
      "nodeOffset": 0,
      "start": 860,
      "end": 942
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 1,
      "index": 50,
