      "y": 663.536,
      "start": 1351,
      "end": 1443,
      "nodeOffset": 0
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 2,
      "index": 32,
      "text": "the input or output sequences [2, 19]. In all but a few cases [27], however, such attention mechanisms",
