      "start": 2626,
      "end": 2675,
      "nodeOffset": 0
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 2,
      "index": 36,
      "text": "The Transformer allows for significantly more parallelization and can reach a new state of the art in",
      "x": 107.691,
      "y": 461.643,
      "start": 2868,
      "end": 2969,
      "nodeOffset": 0
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 2,
      "index": 37,
      "text": "translation quality after being trained for as little as twelve hours on eight P100 GPUs.",
