      "y": 450.734,
      "start": 2970,
      "end": 3059,
      "nodeOffset": 0
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 2,
      "index": 41,
      "text": "The goal of reducing sequential computation also forms the foundation of the Extended Neural GPU",
      "x": 107.691,
      "y": 395.041,
      "start": 3073,
      "end": 3169,
      "nodeOffset": 0
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 2,
      "index": 42,
      "text": "[16], ByteNet [18] and ConvS2S [9], all of which use convolutional neural networks as basic building",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 384.132,
      "start": 3170,
      "end": 3270,
      "nodeOffset": 0
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 2,
      "index": 43,
      "text": "block, computing hidden representations in parallel for all input and output positions. In these models,",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 373.223,
      "start": 3271,
      "end": 3375,
      "nodeOffset": 0
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 2,
      "index": 57,
      "text": "To the best of our knowledge, however, the Transformer is the first transduction model relying",
      "x": 107.691,
      "y": 204.057,
      "start": 4512,
      "end": 4606,
      "nodeOffset": 0
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 2,
      "index": 58,
      "text": "entirely on self-attention to compute representations of its input and output without using sequence-",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 193.148,
      "start": 4607,
      "end": 4708,
      "nodeOffset": 0
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 2,
      "index": 59,
      "text": "aligned RNNs or convolution. In the following sections, we will describe the Transformer, motivate",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 182.239,
      "start": 4708,
      "end": 4806,
      "nodeOffset": 0
    },
    {
      "pageNumber": 3,
      "index": 1,
      "text": "The Transformer follows this overall architecture using stacked self-attention and point-wise, fully",
